 "chunks": [
  {
   "text": "Stuck on a beach",
   "w0": 0,
   "w1": 3,
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 1.28
  },
  {
   "text": "with only one tree,",
   "w0": 4,
   "w1": 7,
   "start": 1.28,
   "end": 2.5
  },
  {
   "text": "you'd sit under it.",
   "w0": 8,
   "w1": 11,
   "start": 2.79,
   "end": 3.6199999999999997
  },
  {
   "text": "Don't.",
   "w0": 12,
   "w1": 12,
   "start": 3.94,
   "end": 4.4
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a manchineel.",
   "w0": 13,
   "w1": 15,
   "start": 4.5600000000000005,
   "end": 5.5600000000000005
  },
  {
   "text": "It has small green apples,",
   "w0": 16,
   "w1": 20,
   "start": 5.930000000000001,
   "end": 7.550000000000001
  },
  {
   "text": "and a red band",
   "w0": 21,
   "w1": 24,
   "start": 7.550000000000001,
   "end": 8.51
  },
  {
   "text": "someone painted on the trunk.",
   "w0": 25,
   "w1": 29,
   "start": 8.51,
   "end": 9.99
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's what that band is for.",
   "w0": 30,
   "w1": 35,
   "start": 10.34,
   "end": 11.84
  },
  {
   "text": "A storm hits,",
   "w0": 36,
   "w1": 38,
   "start": 12.18,
   "end": 13.030000000000001
  },
  {
   "text": "so you shelter under the leaves.",
   "w0": 39,
   "w1": 44,
   "start": 13.120000000000001,
   "end": 14.84
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one holds a milky sap,",
   "w0": 45,
   "w1": 50,
   "start": 15.11,
   "end": 16.92
  },
  {
   "text": "and the rain drips it",
   "w0": 51,
   "w1": 55,
   "start": 16.92,
   "end": 18.07
  },
  {
   "text": "onto your skin.",
   "w0": 56,
   "w1": 58,
   "start": 18.07,
   "end": 18.91
  },
  {
   "text": "Soon you're covered in blisters.",
   "w0": 59,
   "w1": 63,
   "start": 19.26,
   "end": 21.080000000000002
  },
  {
   "text": "The next day you're starving,",
   "w0": 64,
   "w1": 68,
   "start": 21.44,
   "end": 22.75
  },
  {
   "text": "and the apples smell good.",
   "w0": 69,
   "w1": 73,
   "start": 22.75,
   "end": 24.14
  },
  {
   "text": "One bite is sweet,",
   "w0": 74,
   "w1": 77,
   "start": 24.48,
   "end": 25.62
  },
  {
   "text": "for a second.",
   "w0": 78,
   "w1": 80,
   "start": 25.990000000000002,
   "end": 26.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Then your throat burns",
   "w0": 81,
   "w1": 84,
   "start": 27.04,
   "end": 28.42
  },
  {
   "text": "and tightens.",
   "w0": 85,
   "w1": 86,
   "start": 28.42,
   "end": 29.19
  },
  {
   "text": "In Spanish, that fruit is",
   "w0": 87,
   "w1": 91,
   "start": 29.52,
   "end": 31.15
  },
  {
   "text": "the little apple of death.",
   "w0": 92,
   "w1": 96,
   "start": 31.27,
   "end": 32.81
  },
  {
   "text": "Later, nature calls,",
   "w0": 97,
   "w1": 99,
   "start": 33.15,
   "end": 34.46
  },
  {
   "text": "and you grab a handful",
   "w0": 100,
   "w1": 104,
   "start": 34.46,
   "end": 35.67
  },
  {
   "text": "of soft leaves.",
   "w0": 105,
   "w1": 107,
   "start": 35.67,
   "end": 36.61
  },
  {
   "text": "Same sap, same blisters,",
   "w0": 108,
   "w1": 111,
   "start": 36.97,
   "end": 38.84
  },
  {
   "text": "much worse place.",
   "w0": 112,
   "w1": 114,
   "start": 39.08,
   "end": 40.32
  },
  {
   "text": "That night you're cold,",
   "w0": 115,
   "w1": 118,
   "start": 40.68,
   "end": 41.9
  },
  {
   "text": "so you light its wood.",
   "w0": 119,
   "w1": 123,
   "start": 41.99,
   "end": 43.17
  },
  {
   "text": "The smoke stings your eyes",
   "w0": 124,
   "w1": 128,
   "start": 43.48,
   "end": 44.94
  },
  {
   "text": "until you can barely see.",
   "w0": 129,
   "w1": 133,
   "start": 44.94,
   "end": 46.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Next time,",
   "w0": 134,
   "w1": 135,
   "start": 46.75,
   "end": 47.4
  },
  {
   "text": "just sit in the sand.",
   "w0": 136,
   "w1": 140,
   "start": 47.54,
   "end": 48.660000000000004
  },
  {
   "text": "Subscribe for more",
   "w0": 141,
   "w1": 143,
   "start": 48.98,
   "end": 50.08
  },
  {
   "text": "of nature's warnings.",
   "w0": 144,
   "w1": 146,
   "start": 50.08,
   "end": 51.24
  }
 ],
 "sentences": [
  {
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 3.6199999999999997,
   "text": "Stuck on a beach with only one tree, you'd sit under it."
  },
  {
   "start": 3.94,
   "end": 4.4,
   "text": "Don't."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.5600000000000005,
   "end": 5.5600000000000005,
   "text": "It's a manchineel."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.930000000000001,
   "end": 9.99,
   "text": "It has small green apples, and a red band someone painted on the trunk."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.34,
   "end": 11.84,
   "text": "Here's what that band is for."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.18,
   "end": 14.84,
   "text": "A storm hits, so you shelter under the leaves."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.11,
   "end": 18.91,
   "text": "Each one holds a milky sap, and the rain drips it onto your skin."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.26,
   "end": 21.080000000000002,
   "text": "Soon you're covered in blisters."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.44,
   "end": 24.14,
   "text": "The next day you're starving, and the apples smell good."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.48,
   "end": 26.7,
   "text": "One bite is sweet, for a second."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.04,
   "end": 29.19,
   "text": "Then your throat burns and tightens."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.52,
   "end": 32.81,
   "text": "In Spanish, that fruit is the little apple of death."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.15,
   "end": 36.61,
   "text": "Later, nature calls, and you grab a handful of soft leaves."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.97,
   "end": 40.32,
